      "zIndex": 2,
      "locked": false,
      "style": {
        "fill": "rgba(245,241,233,0.05)",
        "stroke": "rgba(245,241,233,0.20)",
        "textColor": "#f2ede4",
        "fontSize": 22,
        "radius": 16,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "textAlign": "left",
        "lineHeight": 1.4,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderWidth": 2
      },
      "text": "**全章第一頁**：第 3 章教我們把損失壓低。**這頁問**：壓低的數字可信嗎？模型怎麼才不會只背答案？\n*Chapter 3 lowered the loss. Can we trust it, and how do we avoid memorising?*",
      "shapeKind": "rectangle"
    },
    "lec04kp00-u01-p1-c1": {
      "id": "lec04kp00-u01-p1-c1",
      "type": "shape",
      "name": "u01-p1-c1",
      "sceneId": "lec04kp00-scene-u01",
      "transform": {
        "x": 60,
        "y": 237,
        "scaleX": 1,
        "scaleY": 1,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "width": 370,
      "height": 237,
      "zIndex": 2,
      "locked": false,
      "style": {
        "fill": "rgba(106,159,214,0.12)",
        "stroke": "rgba(106,159,214,0.65)",
        "textColor": "#f2ede4",
        "fontSize": 22,
        "radius": 16,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "textAlign": "left",
        "lineHeight": 1.4,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderWidth": 2
      },
      "text": "**問題一：數字可信嗎？**\n訓練誤差低，不代表新資料上也低。要先學會誠實評估，並把誤差拆成看得懂的幾項。\n*Is a low training error believable? Evaluate honestly and decompose the error.*",
      "shapeKind": "rectangle"
    },
    "lec04kp00-u01-p1-c2": {
      "id": "lec04kp00-u01-p1-c2",
      "type": "shape",
      "name": "u01-p1-c2",
      "sceneId": "lec04kp00-scene-u01",
      "transform": {
        "x": 455,
        "y": 237,
        "scaleX": 1,
        "scaleY": 1,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "width": 370,
      "height": 237,
      "zIndex": 2,
      "locked": false,
      "style": {
        "fill": "rgba(95,184,168,0.12)",
        "stroke": "rgba(95,184,168,0.65)",
        "textColor": "#f2ede4",
        "fontSize": 22,
        "radius": 16,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "textAlign": "left",
        "lineHeight": 1.4,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderWidth": 2
      },
      "text": "**問題二：為什麼會回升？**\n模型愈複雜，訓練誤差愈低，新資料上的誤差卻先降後升。要看清楚過擬合，才說得清楚。\n*Why does the error on new data rise again? We must see overfitting clearly.*",
      "shapeKind": "rectangle"
    },
    "lec04kp00-u01-p1-c3": {
      "id": "lec04kp00-u01-p1-c3",
      "type": "shape",
      "name": "u01-p1-c3",
      "sceneId": "lec04kp00-scene-u01",
      "transform": {
        "x": 850,
        "y": 237,
        "scaleX": 1,
        "scaleY": 1,
        "rotation": 0
      },
      "width": 370,
      "height": 237,
      "zIndex": 2,
      "locked": false,
      "style": {
        "fill": "rgba(217,119,87,0.12)",
        "stroke": "rgba(217,119,87,0.65)",
        "textColor": "#f2ede4",
        "fontSize": 22,
        "radius": 16,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "textAlign": "left",
        "lineHeight": 1.4,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderWidth": 2
      },
      "text": "**問題三：怎麼不背答案？**\n限制複雜度（正則化），或隨機關掉神經元、把每層輸入穩住。\n*How do we avoid memorising? Regularise, randomise, and normalise.*",
      "shapeKind": "rectangle"
    },
    "lec04kp00-u01-p1-c7": {
      "id": "lec04kp00-u01-p1-c7",
      "type": "shape",
      "name": "u01-p1-c7",
      "sceneId": "lec04kp00-scene-u01",
      "transform": {
        "x": 60,
        "y": 494,
        "scaleX": 1,
