      },
      "width": 1160,
      "height": 119,
      "zIndex": 2,
      "locked": false,
      "style": {
        "fill": "rgba(224,153,95,0.12)",
        "stroke": "rgba(224,153,95,0.65)",
        "textColor": "#f2ede4",
        "fontSize": 22,
        "radius": 16,
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "textAlign": "left",
        "lineHeight": 1.4,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderWidth": 2
      },
      "text": "**全章主線**：訓練誤差會高估模型。\n$\\mathbf{err}$ 是訓練誤差（算得出來）；$\\mathbf{Err}$ 是新資料上的真實誤差（看不到）。複雜度太高時，兩者的差距變大。\n*The training error overestimates the model; the gap grows with the complexity.*",
      "shapeKind": "rectangle"
    },
